00:01:18.345 --> 00:01:24.084 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Effectivement, rapidement,

00:01:20.347 --> 00:01:26.086 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des troupes québécoises se

00:01:22.349 --> 00:01:28.122 size:53% position:73% line:53%
