00:01:54.815 --> 00:01:58.185 size:53% position:73% line:53%
circassien.

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:59.420 size:53% position:73% line:53%
PASCAL JACOB, dir. artistique

00:01:57.251 --> 00:02:00.621 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Festival Mondial Cirque Demain

00:01:58.485 --> 00:02:01.855 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- C'est de prendre conscience

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:03.090 size:53% position:73% line:53%
que le cirque est universel

00:02:00.921 --> 00:02:04.291 size:53% position:73% line:53%
